    "summary": "Builds on the pending 044 port with upstream WebSocket task cancellation, TCP keepalives, reusable split-brain HTTP clients, and a smaller external state-machine dependency surface. Preserves fork persistence formats, recovery gates, storage ownership, truthful shutdown, and durability behavior. Does not release or qualify either downstream consumer.\n",
